	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quid agas, quomodo valeas, ignoro planissime.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Fortas<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sis ita occupatus in Sermonibus tuis emendas, ut vix ocium sit scalpendi <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>aures.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Nacto autem ocio velim paucis, quomodo valeas, significes.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Novi <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nihil habemus, et mirum, quod ex nundinis istis tam pauci libelli venerint <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>prostentque.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l558">Vitenbergenses</placeName> tacent, expectant fortassis meliorem ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><placeName ref="l749">Saxonicę</placeName> statum.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l284">Lipsia</placeName> hęc audivi: "<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Aiunt comitia Caesaris fore <placeName>Ertphordię</placeName>;; quę si fiant, actum erit de <lb xml:id="p1z8"/><placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgensibus</placeName> et <placeName ref="l61">Bremensibus</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Dux <placeName>Borussiae</placeName> etiam sibi timet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Rex <lb xml:id="p1z9"/><placeName ref="l2472">Polonię</placeName> puellam defuncto parente nobilem quandam duxit ac magnas sibi i<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>nimicitias apud suos conciliavit, quod regiam maiestatem adeo laeserit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/><persName>Dantiscum</persName> atque alias quasdam civitates Caesar imperio <placeName ref="l425">Romano</placeName> adiungere <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>conatur, quę sunt regis <placeName ref="l2472">Polonię</placeName>; unde bella horrenda iterum fore suspicor.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/><placeName ref="l302">Lubecum</placeName>, <placeName ref="l204">Hamburgum</placeName>, <placeName ref="l1750">Luneburgum</placeName>, <placeName>Brunopolis</placeName>, <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgum</placeName>, dux <placeName ref="l743">Pomeranię</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>res <placeName ref="l825">Danus</placeName> atque alię quędam urbes evangelicę cum principibus quibusdam <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>denuo conspirarunt se mori potius velle quam in Interim contra conscientiam <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>consentire."</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Hęc ille.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Hiis diebus apud nos legatus a supremo magistro Teutonici ordinis fuit, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>qui ad regem <placeName ref="l832">Galliarum</placeName> proficiscitur; habet pulcherrima dona, quibus regem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>honorare vult.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Praecipue habet duo cochlearia mirabili arte effecta, lapidibus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>pretiosis ornata; puto ex osse nescio cuius animalis facta, quę vom habent contra <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>omne venenum; unum regi, alterum reginę donabit.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quid princeps iste <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>venari velit apud regem fere divino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Item <placeName ref="l2472">Polonus</placeName> quidam prima Maii apud me fuit, in quem forte fortuna incideram [<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>in] <placeName>Foro Piscatorum</placeName>, qui e <placeName ref="l522">Venetiis</placeName> venerat.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Qui magnam nobis spem fecit d[e...] <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>evangelica doctrina in <placeName ref="l2472">Poloniam</placeName> suscipienda; nam regina bene vult evangelio <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>et regem instigat contra episcopos quosdam, qui nihil minus ferre possunt quam <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Christi doctrinam.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> nondum accepit Interim.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Dissentit episcopus cum <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>senatu,</foreign> eptit das sy iren predicanten und allen, die pfaffen sindt gsin, den <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>eidt uffgeben, das sy alle alter und zierden uffrichten, wie sy vorhin <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>gsin sindt; so wil er niemants geben noch zuͦ lassen ein kilch zuͦ predigen <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><foreign xml:lang="la">verbum domini;</foreign> er wils als haben.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Vide illius <persName ref="p18722">Erasmi</persName> ingenium tam vafrum <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>et intoxicatum.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Quis unquam credidisset hominem ex ista dignitate ita mutatum!</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 7. Maii <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>1549 [1549].</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">D. <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName> et <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName> cum reliquis <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>salutabis nomine meo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p1278">G[astius</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Quę in <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName> agant[ur] in hiis inclusis literis <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>invenies, quas mihi remittes.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Brevi catalogum librorum mittam etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Docto ac pio domino <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigu<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>rinę</placeName> ecclesiae pastori vigilantissimo.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de">Go <placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName> an meyster <persName ref="p495">Heinrich Bullinger</persName></s>
				</p>
			</div>
